{"page":539,"verses":[{"verse_key":"57:12","surah":57,"ayah":12,"ar_uthmani":"يَوْمَ تَرَى ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ يَسْعَىٰ نُورُهُم بَيْنَ أَيْدِيهِمْ وَبِأَيْمَـٰنِهِم بُشْرَىٰكُمُ ٱلْيَوْمَ جَنَّـٰتٌ تَجْرِى مِن تَحْتِهَا ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ خَـٰلِدِينَ فِيهَا ۚ ذَٰلِكَ هُوَ ٱلْفَوْزُ ٱلْعَظِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"On the Day when you [Prophet] see the believers, both men and women, with their light streaming out ahead of them and to their right, [they will be told], ‘The good news for you today is that there are Gardens graced with flowing streams where you will stay: that is truly the supreme triumph!’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(On the) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"57:12"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَرَى","en_gloss":"you will see","transliteration":"tarā","verse_key":"57:12"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"the believing men","transliteration":"l-mu'minīna","verse_key":"57:12"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"and the believing women","transliteration":"wal-mu'mināti","verse_key":"57:12"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَسْعَىٰ","en_gloss":"running","transliteration":"yasʿā","verse_key":"57:12"},{"pos":6,"ar":"نُورُهُم","en_gloss":"their light","transliteration":"nūruhum","verse_key":"57:12"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بَيْنَ","en_gloss":"before them","transliteration":"bayna","verse_key":"57:12"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَيْدِيهِمْ","en_gloss":"before them","transliteration":"aydīhim","verse_key":"57:12"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَبِأَيْمَـٰنِهِم","en_gloss":"and on their right","transliteration":"wabi-aymānihim","verse_key":"57:12"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بُشْرَىٰكُمُ","en_gloss":"Glad tidings for you","transliteration":"bush'rākumu","verse_key":"57:12"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"this Day ","transliteration":"l-yawma","verse_key":"57:12"},{"pos":12,"ar":"جَنَّـٰتٌۭ","en_gloss":"gardens","transliteration":"jannātun","verse_key":"57:12"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَجْرِى","en_gloss":"flowing","transliteration":"tajrī","verse_key":"57:12"},{"pos":14,"a